<title>USA: J. Baker same-store sales up 8 pct.</title>
<headline>J. Baker same-store sales up 8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Mass. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>J. Baker Inc Thursday reported sales for the four weeks and nine months ended November 2.</p>
<p>	     Sales in millions of dollars     Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		  $73	  $70	+4.1	 +8.0</p>
<p>Year-to-date	$650	 $749	  NA	   NA</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
